            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale operatore esegue il blocco di codice di un'istruzione if quando due valori sono diversi?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>!=</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>==</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>!=</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Different comparisons",
            "id": 126749,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quali operatori possiamo usare per fare confronti nelle condizioni delle istruzioni if?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>&gt;=</code>, <code>&lt;=</code>, <code>&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;</code>, <code>==</code> e <code>!=</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Solo <code>==</code> e <code>!=</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>&gt;=</code>, <code>&lt;=</code>, <code>&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;</code>, <code>==</code> e <code>!=</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Condition",
            "id": 126750,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quali tipi possiamo confrontare usando <code>==</code> nelle condizioni?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Numeri, stringhe e booleani</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Solo numeri e stringhe</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Numeri, stringhe e booleani.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Variables",
            "id": 126751,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Come possiamo evitare di riscrivere più volte lo stesso confronto?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Possiamo salvare il suo risultato in una variabile e riutilizzare la variabile</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Non possiamo evitarlo, perché i confronti non possono essere salvati per dopo</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Possiamo salvare il suo risultato in una variabile e riutilizzare la variabile.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Good decisions",
            "id": 126752,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Scrivi una condizione che esegua il codice se <code>replayTimes</code> è maggiore o uguale a <code>300</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" song = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Don't stop me now&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" replayTimes = \" /><text value=\"345\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" replayTimes &gt;= \" /><text value=\"300\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Your top song this week: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(song)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"74\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"song == 300\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Your top song this week: \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Don't stop me now\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>replayTimes &gt;= 300</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Correct answers",
            "id": 126753,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Scrivi una condizione per suggerire un ristorante se <code>diet</code> dell'utente è uguale a <code>vegetarian</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" diet = \" /><text value=\"&quot;vegetarian&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" veggieRestaurant = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Root&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" restaurant = \" /><text value=\"&quot;DelPosto&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" diet == \" /><text value=\"&quot;vegetarian&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Try out: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + veggieRestaurant)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"85\" endIndex=\"89\" /><option startIndex=\"90\" endIndex=\"92\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"!==\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Try out: Root\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>diet</code>, seguito da <code>==</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Wrong answers",
            "id": 126754,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Usa <code>!=</code> come condizione per eseguire il blocco di codice se <code>today</code> non è <code>Saturday</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" today = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Sunday&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" today != \" /><text value=\"&quot;Saturday&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Set alarm at 8:00&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"32\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Set alarm at 8:00\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>today !=</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Different comparisons",
            "id": 126755,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Usa <code>&gt;</code> per scrivere una condizione che verifichi se l'<code>age</code> dell'utente è maggiore di <code>18</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" age = \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" canDrive = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" age &gt; \" /><text value=\"18\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" canDrive = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(canDrive)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"45\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>age &gt; 18</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Variables",
            "id": 126756,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Memorizza il confronto di uguaglianza tra <code>inboxFull</code> e <code>true</code> all'interno di <code>showAlert</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" inboxFull = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" showAlert = inboxFull == \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" showAlert {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Your inbox is full.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;You can't receive any more emails&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"54\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"inboxFull != true\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Your inbox is full.\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"You can't receive any more emails\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>inboxFull == true</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Condition",
            "id": 126757,
